    "keystrokes": "\\documentclass{article}\n\\usepackage{graphicx} % Required for inserting images\n\n\n\\title{The ethics of artificial intelligence principles, challenges, and opportunities}\n\\author{}\n\\date{July 2024}\n\n\n\\begin{document}\n\n\n\\maketitle\n\n\n\\section{Introduction}\n\n\nArtificial Intelligence or AI is an advanced technology which is continuously progressing and is present most of the fields including industries, smart cities and healthcare. With its rapid growth, there are various merits and demerits to it. The ethics of this technology plays a very crucial role in progressing or advancement of the society.  \nSome examples where ethics are used in real world in terms of AI are: decision and judgement making in self driven cars, biased algorithms which are used in social media and many more, which leads to the realization of how crucial role ethics plays in artificial intelligence (Vakkuri & Abrahamsson, 2018).\n\n\nBecause of its various use cases, AI is widely spread everywhere. The use of AI in human societies is a matter of normative ethics rather than just the descriptive ethics (Jameel, Ali & Toheed, 2020). The safety application aspect in terms of ethics in AI is most researched upon for betterment of the technology. \n\n\nSome of the domains and ethical issues in AI are (Jameel, Ali & Toheed, 2020)\n\n\n1. Inequality\n2. Unemployment\n3. Regulatory Approaches\n4. Biases \n   - Behavioral Biases\n   - Population Biases\n   - Linking Biases\n5. Commitment to Cause \n6. Humanity\n\n\n\\section{Challenges}\n\n\nThe challenges of ethic of AI mainly covers:\n1. Society\n- Autonomy & Wellbeing\n- Unemployment\n\n\n2. Consumer\nIn terms of consumer level, the heavy dependance in AI technologies in big data\n- Privacy\n- Cybersecurity\n\n\n3. Product\n\n\nIn terms of product level because of their higher computing power and self autonomous nature, the technology sometimes can alters individual decisions (Du & Xie, 2021). The two prominent problems in the product level are:\n- AI Biases\n- Ethical Design\n\n\n\\section{Conclusion}\n\n\nThe AI technology as a whole is very revolutionary in terms of change in the society but being a technology its very crucial to have implemented its uses properly by properly taking care of its ethics. \n\n\n\n\n\\end{document}\n\n\n\n",
